### 7.4包装类

####装箱(基本->包装)

| 基本类型  | 包装类      |
| --------- | ----------- |
| `byte`    | `Byte`      |
| `short`   | `Short`     |
| `int`     | `Integer` ⭐ |
| `long`    | `Long`      |
| `float`   | `Float`     |
| `double`  | `Double`    |
| `char`    | `Character` |
| `boolean` | `Boolean`   |

```java
int a = 10;
Integer b = Integer.valueOf(a);
//自动装箱
int a = 10;
Integer b = a;
```

#### 拆箱

```java
Integer a = 10;
int b = a.intValue();
```

#### 类型转换

```java
int num = 123;
String s = String.valueOf(num);
```

